# Dyslexia-Friendly Spelling & Grammar Corrector (from scratch, PyTorch)

This README documents `grammar_corrector.py` completely: what each part does, how the data is turned
into what the networks receive, why each choice was made, what the mathematics behind it says, what
went wrong in earlier versions and why, and where the current design is still weak.

